            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFor more (or fewer) days\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInclude different excursions\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInclude UK airport coach transfers\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInclude all entrance fee\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "If you\u0027d like to adjust what\u0027s included, perhaps a different hotel standard, more or fewer days, or different excursions, here are some alternatives:"
